{"page":54,"width":1919,"height":2771,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"이 요구 사항을 살펴보면 핵은 양방향으로 매우 빠르게 확장할 수 있어야 하며, 모든 원소에 임의","words":[{"text":"이","x":207,"y":186,"width":30,"height":38},{"text":"요구","x":253,"y":186,"width":68,"height":36},{"text":"사항을","x":334,"y":184,"width":100,"height":40},{"text":"살펴보면","x":445,"y":186,"width":137,"height":40},{"text":"핵은","x":598,"y":185,"width":68,"height":39},{"text":"양방향으로","x":679,"y":185,"width":165,"height":40},{"text":"매우","x":858,"y":189,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"빠르게","x":937,"y":185,"width":99,"height":41},{"text":"확장할","x":1051,"y":185,"width":105,"height":39},{"text":"수","x":1166,"y":186,"width":35,"height":38},{"text":"있어야","x":1215,"y":186,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"하며,","x":1326,"y":186,"width":76,"height":40},{"text":"모든","x":1419,"y":187,"width":70,"height":36},{"text":"원소에","x":1502,"y":183,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"임의","x":1619,"y":182,"width":64,"height":38}]},{"text":"접근을 제공해야 합니다. 그러므로 자료 구조가 벡터와 비슷하지만, 앞쪽과 뒤쪽으로 모두 확장","words":[{"text":"접근을","x":208,"y":256,"width":101,"height":40},{"text":"제공해야","x":324,"y":256,"width":133,"height":41},{"text":"합니다.","x":472,"y":259,"width":111,"height":38},{"text":"그러므로","x":603,"y":258,"width":136,"height":38},{"text":"자료","x":754,"y":260,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"구조가","x":834,"y":261,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"벡터와","x":951,"y":259,"width":103,"height":39},{"text":"비슷하지만,","x":1070,"y":259,"width":175,"height":39},{"text":"앞쪽과","x":1265,"y":259,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"뒤쪽으로","x":1382,"y":260,"width":137,"height":37},{"text":"모두","x":1533,"y":260,"width":70,"height":36},{"text":"확장","x":1617,"y":256,"width":71,"height":38}]},{"text":"할 수 있다는 점이 다릅니다. 원소 삽입과 삭제 시 n/2 단계를 허용한다는 점에서 이 연산이 모든","words":[{"text":"할","x":206,"y":332,"width":34,"height":36},{"text":"수","x":251,"y":330,"width":35,"height":38},{"text":"있다는","x":301,"y":329,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"점이","x":412,"y":332,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"다릅니다.","x":49